        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you open your eyes, you find yourself on a familiar stairs. You are trapped in a school where time seems to have stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From somewhere, you hear a voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one of the classrooms, a girl stands quietly. Even when you try to speak to her, she does not respond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the empty school building, your only option is to head for the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“NO LIFE BABY OF THE END” is a walking simulator set in a school overrun by zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to your surroundings  and make your way to the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Streaming Guideline】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for choosing to play “No Life Baby of the End”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ILCA, Inc. permits the posting and live streaming of videos that use game footage from <i>No Life Baby of the End</i>—including introductions, gameplay/commentary, and explanatory content—by individuals or organizations, whether for-profit or non-profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please comply with the guidelines below.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the link to the store page in the video/stream description</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include “No Life Baby of the End” or “No Life Baby” in the video title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is permitted only when using features provided by each video-sharing platform, such as the “YouTube Partner Program.”</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ILCA, Inc. disclaims all liability for any losses or damages resulting from the uploading or distribution (including live streaming) of game-related videos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ILCA, Inc retains the right to pursue legal remedies with respect to inappropriate content, including b